msolveEliminate -- compute the elimination ideal of a given ideal
*****************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        msolveEliminate(I,elimVars)
  * Inputs:
      * I, an *note ideal: (Macaulay2Doc)Ideal,, in a polynomial ring with
        *note GRevLex: (Macaulay2Doc)GRevLex, order and coefficients over *note
        ZZ/p: (Macaulay2Doc)finite fields, in characteristic less than $2^{31}$
      * elimVars, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, of variables in the same
        ring as I, these variables will be eliminated
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * Threads => an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, default value 5, number
        of processor threads to use;
      * Verbosity => an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, default value 0,
        level of verbosity between 0, 1, and 2;
  * Outputs:
      * GB, a *note matrix: (Macaulay2Doc)Matrix,, whose columns are generators
        for the elimination ideal

Description
===========

This function takes as input a polynomial ideal and computes the elimination
ideal given by eliminating the variables specified in the inputted list.

The behavior is very different over finite (prime) fields, and the rationals.
Over *note QQ: (Macaulay2Doc)QQ,, the subideal over a smaller set of variables
eliminating the given ones is returned. Over a finite field, the Groebner basis
in the product order eliminating the given block of variables is returned
(warning: this is a copy of the ring with potentially permuted variables).

First an example over the rationals.

+---------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[x,a,b,c,d]                                         |
|                                                               |
|o1 = R                                                         |
|                                                               |
|o1 : PolynomialRing                                            |
+---------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : f = 7*x^2+a*x+b                                           |
|                                                               |
|       2                                                       |
|o2 = 7x  + x*a + b                                             |
|                                                               |
|o2 : R                                                         |
+---------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : g = 2*x^2+c*x+d                                           |
|                                                               |
|       2                                                       |
|o3 = 2x  + x*c + d                                             |
|                                                               |
|o3 : R                                                         |
+---------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : M2elim=eliminate(x,ideal(f,g))                            |
|                                                               |
|                        2     2               2              2 |
|o4 = ideal(2a*b*c - 7b*c  - 2a d + 7a*c*d - 4b  + 28b*d - 49d )|
|                                                               |
|o4 : Ideal of R                                                |
+---------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : Msolveelim=msolveEliminate(x,ideal(f,g))                  |
|                                                               |
|                        2     2               2              2 |
|o5 = ideal(2a*b*c - 7b*c  - 2a d + 7a*c*d - 4b  + 28b*d - 49d )|
|                                                               |
|o5 : Ideal of QQ[a..d]                                         |
+---------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : sub(M2elim,ring Msolveelim)==Msolveelim                   |
|                                                               |
|o6 = true                                                      |
+---------------------------------------------------------------+

We can also work over a finite field. Here we get the full Groebner basis in
the permuted variables with a block order.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : R = ZZ/1073741827[x,y,a,b,c,d]                                          |
|                                                                             |
|o7 = R                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o7 : PolynomialRing                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : f = c*x^2+a*x+b*y^2+d*x*y+y                                             |
|                                                                             |
|      2     2                                                                |
|o8 = y b + x c + x*y*d + x*a + y                                             |
|                                                                             |
|o8 : R                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i9 : g = diff(x,f)                                                           |
|                                                                             |
|o9 = 2x*c + y*d + a                                                          |
|                                                                             |
|o9 : R                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i10 : h = diff(y,f)                                                          |
|                                                                             |
|o10 = 2y*b + x*d + 1                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o10 : R                                                                      |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i11 : M2elim = eliminate({x,y}, ideal(f,g,h))                                |
|                                                                             |
|             2                                                               |
|o11 = ideal(a b - a*d + c)                                                   |
|                                                                             |
|o11 : Ideal of R                                                             |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i12 : Msolveelim = msolveEliminate({x,y}, ideal(f,g,h))                      |
|                                                                             |
|              2                             2                      2         |
|o12 = ideal (a b - a*d + c, y*a*d - 2y*c + a , y*b*c - 268435457y*d  -       |
|      -----------------------------------------------------------------------|
|      268435457a*d - 536870913c, y*a*b + 536870913y*d - 536870913a, x*d +    |
|      -----------------------------------------------------------------------|
|      2y*b + 1, x*c - 536870913y*d - 536870913a, x*a + y)                    |
|                                                                             |
|                   ZZ                                                        |
|o12 : Ideal of ----------[x..y, a..d]                                        |
|               1073741827                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i13 : M2elim_0 == sub(Msolveelim_0, R)                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o13 = true                                                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

